"一次连接一个服务。切换不删除本机笔记，各服务授权彼此独立。切回后，未过期配对可继续同步。" = "Connect to one service at a time. Switching keeps local notes and each service has separate permissions. Unexpired pairings resume when you switch back.";
"iPhone 在前台、Mac App 运行时同步。笔记端到端加密，服务只转发密文。配对链接包含密钥，请勿公开。网页授权 7 天、设备授权 1 年有效。" = "Keep iPhone in the foreground or the Mac app running to sync. Notes are end-to-end encrypted; the relay only forwards ciphertext. Keep pairing links private. Browser access lasts 7 days; device access lasts 1 year.";
"笔记保存在本机及已同步的设备。没有云备份，请另行保留重要内容的副本。" = "Notes stay on this device and devices you sync with. There is no cloud backup; keep separate copies of important notes.";
"文字、链接和 Markdown。\niPhone、Mac 与网页，接着写。" = "Text, links, and Markdown.\nKeep writing across iPhone, Mac, and web.";
