"发现配对链接，请到「配对与服务」确认网址" = "Pairing link found. Confirm its address in Pairing & Services.";
"NoteBaton 接力，让文字、链接和 Markdown 在 iPhone、Mac 与浏览器之间同步。无需注册，原生设备各有本地副本。" = "Sync notes, links, and Markdown across iPhone, Mac, and web. No account required. Each native device keeps a local copy.";
"正文保存在已同步的 iPhone 与 Mac。内容在设备上加密，中转服务只转发密文，没有笔记解密密钥。" = "Synced iPhones and Macs store your notes. Content is encrypted on-device; the relay forwards ciphertext without decryption keys.";
"界面示意 · 正文保存在你的设备" = "Interface preview · Notes stay on your devices";
"让已配对的 iPhone App 保持前台，或 Mac App 保持运行，即可在网页阅读和编辑。原生设备间自动同步，支持离线编辑。" = "Keep the paired iPhone app in the foreground or the Mac app running to read and edit on the web. Native devices sync automatically and support offline editing.";
"不需要。iPhone 和 Mac 各自保存笔记。网页或新设备展示配对码，由你在已有设备确认授权。" = "No. iPhone and Mac each store notes locally. Authorize a browser or new device by confirming its pairing code on an existing device.";
"已配对设备离线后，网页还能用吗？" = "Does the web app work when its paired device is offline?";
"可以阅读当前页面已加载内容。保存修改和加载更多需要网页配对的设备在线：iPhone App 在前台，或 Mac App 保持运行。未同步网页草稿仅保留在本页。" = "You can read notes already loaded on this page. Saving and loading more require the paired device online: iPhone in the foreground, or the Mac app running. Unsynced web drafts stay only on this page.";
"只配对可信网站与自己的设备。已配对设备离线时，网页仍可阅读本页已加载的笔记。" = "Only pair trusted websites and your own devices. When the paired device is offline, loaded web notes remain readable.";
"没有云备份。已同步的原生设备各有副本；若丢失所有副本，笔记无法找回。删除也会传播，请另行备份重要内容。" = "There is no cloud backup. Each synced native device has a copy; losing all copies loses the notes. Deletions also propagate, so keep independent backups.";
